      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Terrified by Nastya's sudden affectionate behavior, Kostya runs into the kitchen begging for help. Right behind him, Max appears yet again, and Senya and Fedya persuade Chef Barinov to simply step outside with Max and listen to what he has to say so he will finally leave.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мне тебя и так очень...",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Костян, спасай меня!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
